+       - Masked image icons use empty `content: ""`, which exposes nothing.
+       - Text glyph flourishes use `content: "<glyph>" / ""` (empty alt text)
+         so they are not read aloud. A single-value `content` declaration
+         precedes each one so older browsers don't drop the rule as invalid. */
